     "markdown": "- **A face that waits for you**: while Face ID looks, the lock becomes a Face ID face that looks at you, blinks slowly and glances around\n- **Passcode screen too**: the lock up top is the animated face the whole time\n- **Unlock like Apple, smoother**: the brackets curl into a ring that spins, then a check draws itself and the open lock pops back\n- **No match**: the face shakes like jelly\n- **Matches your wallpaper**: same color as Apple's lock, light or dark\n- **Live preview in Settings**, haptics switch\n- **Notched iPhones only** (X to 14); turns itself off on Dynamic Island iPhones",
